    "facility_layer": "Only the three setup-chart factories are new placements. Printed ports, shipyards and airbases already represented in map.json are referenced separately, never duplicated as setup pieces.",
    "unlisted_locations": "Western Manchuria, P33 and P41 have no Japanese setup-chart entry; absence means no placed Japanese pieces there, not missing transcription.",
    "queues": "User-approved national starting queues are retained separately from deployed pieces. No starting tile is assigned; completion uses an eligible retained shipyard and normal placement requirements. Paid stages are reconciled in source_reconciliation.md."
